| G2     | Deliver Food | Ensure food is delivered to the room. | - | Achieve | AND (with G4) |
| G2a    | Unassisted Delivery | Navigate and place food. | ; | Perform | AND (with G2b) |
| G2b    | Tray-Based Delivery | Deliver via tray with assistance if needed. | - | Achieve | OR (with G2a) |
| G4     | Retrieve Dishes | Ensure dirty dishes are collected. | - | Achieve | AND (with G2) |
| G4a    | Unassisted Retrieval | Robot retrieves dishes alone. | - | Perform | AND (with G4b) |
| G4b    | Assisted Retrieval | Retrieve with help if needed. | - | Perform | OR (with G4a) |

